# --- what a run leaves behind -----------------------------------------------------------------
# `--headless shot.png` writes its still wherever the run started, which is usually the repo root,
# and a 1280x720 frame is two megabytes. Only the root is covered, so docs keep their images.
# Play-session journals (`--journal`). They are evidence about one run, not source.
journal/
/*.png
/*.log

